u's roughly $1.1 million, and no outside groups have invested in the race on either side.\n\nEvery major race rater places the contest in the Safe or Solid Democratic column, and both Kalshi and Polymarket price a Democratic win at 97 percent. Early vote-by-mail returns show Democrats dominating, and the Bergen Record has endorsed Pou. Deportation policy has complicated Republican outreach to the district's Hispanic voters, but the fundamentals still point clearly toward Pou.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.969, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9625, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9596, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9671, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9566, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9555, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9611, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9621, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9669, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9744, "margin": 13.4}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9683, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.969, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9657, "margin": 12.8}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9546, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9588, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9626, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9636, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9617, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9617, "margin": 13.4}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.956, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9695, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9662, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9629, "margin": 12.8}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.964, "margin": 13.3}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.956, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.9597, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_de